  "privacyS3HighlightLabel": "Short version:",
  "privacyS3Highlight": "You keep the copyright to your idea. By submitting, you license it openly under CC BY 4.0 — so any scientist, NGO, or government can use it to fight nanoplastic pollution. We credit you. No one can lock the idea away.",
